-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",56,{
[1761]="7006F08B\n1\tCheck behind the house for any abandoned tools\tAshnân needs your help gathering the tools abandoned by the farm-hands in Burukíri. He suggested checking behind the house first.\n2\tGather abandoned shovels (total: 2)\tYou spotted some abandoned tools behind the house in Burukíri. Gather them so they can be returned to Ashnân.\n3\tCheck by the beehives for any abandoned tools\tAshnân needs your help gathering the tools abandoned by the farm-hands in Burukíri. He said to check by the beehives next.\n4\tGather abandoned axes (total: 2)\tYou spotted some abandoned tools near the beehives in Burukíri. Gather them so they can be returned to Ashnân.\n5\tCheck around the mill for any abandoned tools\tAshnân needs your help gathering the tools abandoned by the farm-hands in Burukíri. Ashnân thinks there may be some left by the mill.\n6\tGather abandoned shovels (total: 4)\030Gather abandoned axes (total: 3)\tYou spotted some abandoned tools near the mill in Burukíri. Gather them so they can be returned to Ashnân.\n7\tReturn to Ashnân in Burukíri\tReturn to Ashnân in Burukíri and give him the abandoned tools you were able to recover.\n",
[1762]="70053F1D\n1\tGather blunt swords (total: 8)\tBlunt swords can be found in Díngarth. You should gather blunt swords.\n2\tSharpen swords on the grindstone (quantity: see journal)\tA grindstone can be found in Díngarth. You should sharpen the swords on the grindstone.\n3\tGive the sharpened swords to Radigond\tRadigond can be found in Díngarth. You should give the sharpened swords to Radigond.\n",
[1763]="7006B8CF\n1\tSeize Orc weapons (total: 10)\tUsing the information from the scouting report gathered from Emlû, Galâmka has asked you to take weapons from the Orcs in Maurûsh so they can arm themselves.\n2\tGive the weapons to Galâmka in Ub Nishir\tReturn to Galâmka in Ub Nishir with the weapons you have retrieved in Maurûsh.\n",
[1764]="70030F63\n1\tTake Uruk-hai swords from the cave\tThe Uruk-hai rebels are located in a cave, west of Caddabrand's camp. The Uruk weapons have been carelessly left throughout the cave, leaving them ripe for removal.\n2\tTake Uruk-hai swords from the cave (total: 8)\tThe Uruk-hai rebels are located in a cave, west of Caddabrand's camp. The Uruk weapons have been carelessly left throughout the cave, leaving them ripe for removal.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have removed several of the Uruk-hai weapons from the possession of the enemy.\n",
[1765]="7003EA6F\n1\tCollect pelts from the bears of the Bruinen Gorges\tThere are mountain-bears dwelling in the Bruinen Gorges, in the Trollshaws. While you are in the Bruinen Gorges, you should hunt bears for pelts.\n2\tCollect pelts from the bears of the Bruinen Gorges (total: 6)\tThere are mountain-bears dwelling in the Bruinen Gorges, in the Trollshaws. While you are in the Bruinen Gorges, you should hunt bears for pelts.\n3\tBring the pelts you collected to one of the dwarves encamped at Thorenhad\tThere are dwarves encamped with the Elves at Thorenhad in the Bruinen Gorges. You should bring the pelts you collected to one of the dwarves encamped at Thorenhad.\n",
[1766]="7002EDF7\n1\tCollect spools of thread from Nothgyth\030Collect sewing-needles from Ordbéorth\030Collect aurochs-hides (total: 5)\tOffram has given you the hides you need. Thread can be obtained from Nothgyth in the southern part of the city. Ordbéorth in the northern part of the city can provide sewing-needles. Offram has asked you to collect the hides, thread, and needles necessary to make warm blankets for the people of Eaworth.\n2\tSew warm blankets for the people of Eaworth\tThe infirmary's sewing-table can be found outside the infirmary in Eaworth. Offram asked you to sew warm blankets for the people of Eaworth.\n3\tPeople in need of warm blankets can be found throughout Eaworth. Offram wants you to deliver the warm blankets you sewed to the people of Eaworth.\t\n4\tTalk to Offram outside the Vendor Hall in Eaworth\tOffram stands guard outside the Vendor Hall in Eaworth. You should let Offram know that you have delivered the blankets as he had asked.\n",
[1767]="7000003A\n1\tBring wolf-hides to Arinora\030Collect wolf-hides (total: 8)\tWolves can be found in the ruins of Minas Eriol south of The Forsaken Inn, among the Weather Hills to the north-east, and in the Midgewater Pass to the north. Arinora of The Forsaken Inn asked you to collect wolf-hides so she can make blankets for the inn's guests.\n",
[1768]="7000AC4D\n1\tTalk to Soldier Kaasak at Tol Ascarnen\030Collect Leafcull Heartwood\tThe Leafcull Huorns make their home in the southern woods of Hithlad. Find the Huorn amonst the trees south of the Grimwood Lumber Camp in Hithlad, to the south-west of Tol Ascarnen. Angmar's forces at Tol Ascarnen are building a horn to call reinforcements to the fight when the Free Peoples return to assault the area. Kaasak has tasked you with collecting the heartwood of a Leafcull Huorn to act as the stand upon which the horn will rest. Damaging the heartwood will make it useless.\n",
[1769]="70070CC6\n1\tDefeat spiders in Thalat Tîr (total: 12)\030Gather venom (total: 6)\tYour mission is to travel north to Thalat Tîr to thin the numbers of vicious spiders in the area as well as bring back samples of their venom for the Sul Madásh scholars.\n2\tDefeat the blight-matron!\tYour mission is to travel north to Thalat Tîr to thin the numbers of vicious spiders in the area as well as bring back samples of their venom for the Sul Madásh scholars.\n",
[1770]="70052B21\n1\tBurn the remains of blighted livestock (total: 12)\tLivestock slain by the blight of the Taurogrim can be found throughout Tríubad. Fearing the blight of the Taurogrim will spread from those that succumbed to it, Vilibald has asked you to burn the remains of slain livestock at Tríubad.\n2\tCompleted\tYou burned the remains of slain livestock at Tríubad.\n",
[1771]="70072F8C\n1\tDefeat blighted spiders east of Sul Madásh (total: 10)\tMálacál has asked that you travel to the east of Sul Madásh and help her and her hunters thin the number of blighted spiders that can be found.\n2\tReturn to Málacál\tReturn to Málacál near Sul Madásh and report your success of defeating spiders in eastern Adagím.\n",
[1772]="7002EE34\n1\tDefeat mounted enemies in the Entwash Vale\t\n2\tDefeat mounted enemies in the Entwash Vale (total: 8)\tMounted enemies can be found throughout the Entwash Vale. You should take the opportunity to rid the Entwash Vale of some of the Enemy's mounted scouts.\n3\tTalk to Góda in the Mead Hall of Eaworth\tLady Góda is in the Mead Hall of Eaworth, in the Entwash Vale. You should return to Góda and let her know what you have done.\n",
[1773]="7002EE45\n1\tDefeat mounted enemies in the Entwash Vale\t\n2\tDefeat mounted enemies in the Entwash Vale (total: 8)\tMounted enemies can be found throughout the Entwash Vale. You should take the opportunity to clear some of the mounted scouts of the Enemy from the Entwash Vale.\n3\tTalk to Ingmar in the Mead Hall of Eaworth\tLord Ingmar is in the Mead Hall of Eaworth, in the Entwash Vale. You should return to Lord Ingmar and let him know what you have done.\n",
[1774]="70041C6F\n1\tPatrol Dol Brannor\tDol Brannor can be found to north-west of Linhir in Dor-en-Ernil. Herion has asked you to patrol the beacon of Dol Brannor and defeat any of the Enemy's forces that have made camp there.\n2\tDefeat Corsair snipers at Dol Brannor (total: 6)\030Defeat the Haradrim War-master at Dol Brannor\tCorsair snipers can be found around Dol Brannor in Dor-en-Ernil. You have discovered a group of Corsairs led by a Haradrim War-master. You should defeat them before they can slay more travellers on the roads below.\n3\tTalk to Herion in Linhir\tHerion can be found in Linhir in eastern Dor-en-Ernil. You have crippled the forces at Dol Brannor, at least for the moment, and should now return to Herion.\n",
[1775]="7006AED3\n1\tDefeat Ghamêla\030Defeat Hênakh\tDefeat the leaders of the cultists spread throughout Jâx Ugikh. Locate and defeat Ghamêla and Hênakh.\n2\tTalk to Azrât in Kên Taghlim\tInform Azrât in Kên Taghlim and let her know that Ghamêla and Hênakh have been defeated.\n",
[1776]="70049557\n1\tZôreth's watching-stones can be found along the causeway to Lûghash and Barad-dûr in Dor Amarth. Spakorth has asked you to challenge Zôreth's watching-stones and drive out the evil spirits bound to them.\t\n2\tTalk to Spakorth at Lûghash\tSpakorth can be found outside the lower gates to Lûghash in Dor Amarth. You have forced Zôreth's fell spirits from the watching-stones, but some appear to have returned to her keeping in Lûghash. You should meet with Spakorth and tell him what has happened.\n",
[1777]="70017592\n1\tAcquire evidence of dwarf-worker's passage\tThe dwarf-worker was rumoured to have passed through the heart of the Redhorn Lodes, by the east to west mine cart track just north of the passage leading into the Flaming Deeps. You should collect evidence of his passage and bring it to Armbeald, who wishes to see the progress of the dwarf's mission.\n2\tReturn to Armbeald in the Redhorn Lodes\tArmbeald is at the Orc-watch in the Redhorn Lodes of Moria, north-west from where you found evidence of the dwarf's remains. You should return to Armbeald with the skull you have found, which has been cleaned of all its flesh.\n",
[1778]="700454FF\n1\tDefeat Variags in Taur Drúadan (total: 10)\tVariags can be found in their blockade in Taur Drúadan. You should defeat Variags in Taur Drúadan.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many Variags in Taur Drúadan.\n",
[1779]="7005B113\n1\tDefeat Orcs and goblins at Zaghúth (total: 14)\030Defeat Warg-riders at Zaghúth (total: 6)\030Destroy Orkish barricades at Zaghúth (total: 8)\tOrcs, goblins, Warg-riders, and barricades can be found at Zaghúth. King Thráin has commanded you to join in the assault at Zaghúth. You should aid the Haban'akkâ of Thráin.\n2\tRaise a banner of the Haban'akkâ of Thráin at Zaghúth\tYou have done much to hinder the Orcs and their vile allies at Zaghúth. You should raise a banner of the Haban'akkâ of Thráin at Zaghúth.\n",
[1780]="7005B188\n1\tDestroy Orkish barricades at Zaghúth\tOrkish barricades can be found at Zaghúth. You should destroy Orkish barricades at Zaghúth.\n2\tDestroy Orkish barricades at Zaghúth (total: 8)\tOrkish barricades can be found at Zaghúth. You should destroy Orkish barricades at Zaghúth.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have destroyed many Orkish barricades at Zaghúth.\n",
[1781]="70062F1C\n1\tSpeak with the Blogmal emissary\tYou may seek the blessing of the Blogmal clan. All you need do is renounce all other clans.\n",
[1782]="70071D8D\n1\tSpeak with TBD in TBD when you are ready to go\tSpeak with TBD in TBD when you are ready to go.\n2\tSpeak with TBD in TBD\tSpeak with TBD in TBD.\n",
[1783]="70071D90\n1\tSpeak with TBD in TBD when you are ready to go\tSpeak with TBD in TBD when you are ready to go.\n2\tSpeak with TBD in TBD\tSpeak with TBD in TBD.\n",
[1784]="70071D8B\n1\tSpeak with TBD in TBD when you are ready to go\tSpeak with TBD in TBD when you are ready to go.\n2\tSpeak with TBD in TBD\tSpeak with TBD in TBD.\n",
[1785]="70071D84\n1\tSpeak with TBD in TBD when you are ready to go\tSpeak with TBD in TBD when you are ready to go.\n2\tSpeak with TBD in TBD\tSpeak with TBD in TBD.\n",
[1786]="70071D7E\n1\tSpeak with TBD in TBD when you are ready to go\tSpeak with TBD in TBD when you are ready to go.\n2\tSpeak with TBD in TBD\tSpeak with TBD in TBD.\n",
[1787]="7004148C\n1\tTalk to Erchar\tErchar can be found in Linhir in eastern Dor-en-Ernil. Erchar has asked you to aid him in protecting Linhir from a renewed attack. You should speak to him when you are ready.\n2\tTalk to Erchar in Linhir\tErchar can be found in Linhir in eastern Dor-en-Ernil. You have defeated the attacking forces from Dor-en-Ernil and Lebennin, but at the cost of Garvir's life. You should speak to Erchar.\n",
[1788]="70035863\n1\tDefeat White Hand Orcs while searching for Thrymm's body (total: 8)\tWhite Hand Orcs can be found around the area where Thrymm was thrown by Núrzum. You should defeat White Hand Orcs.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated a number of marauding Orcs in the Writhendowns, avenging the dead in Scylfig.\n",
[1789]="70059DFD\n1\tTalk to Durin at Annâk-khurfu\tDurin can be found in the war-room at Annâk-khurfu. Glóin has asked you to speak to Durin.\n2\tTravel to Zarkul-sulûn in the War of Three Peaks\tZarkul-sulûn can be found in the War of Three Peaks. Durin has asked you to return to the war-front and seek the counsel of his uncle, Náin, at Zarkul-sulûn. NOTE: You may access the War of Three Peaks by using the Blazon of the Gabil'akkâ behind Durin in Annâk-khurfu or by taking a travel route from the stable-master outside Annâk-khurfu.\n3\tTalk to Náin the Slakeless at Zarkul-sulûn\tNáin the Slakeless can be found at Zarkul-sulûn in the War of Three Peaks. Durin has asked you to return to the war-front and seek the counsel of his uncle, Náin, at Zarkul-sulûn.\n4\tDefeat enemies in the War of Three Peaks (total: 10)\030Talk to Agnar Brokentooth\030Talk to Lági Helmbiter\030Talk to Reithvald Red-ember\tEnemies can be found throughout the War of Three Peaks. Agnar Brokentooth, Lági Helmbiter, and Reithvald Red-ember of the Kharum-ubnâr can be found at Zarkul-sulûn and nearby encampments during the War of Three Peaks. Náin the Slakeless, uncle of Durin, has asked you to present Durin's plan to reclaim Mount Gundabad to Agnar Brokentooth, Lági Helmbiter, and Reithvald Red-ember. He has also asked you to slay enemies of the Gabil'akkâ in the War of Three Peaks. NOTE: You may access the War of Three Peaks by using the Blazon of the Gabil'akkâ behind Durin in Annâk-khurfu or by taking a travel route from the stable-master outside Annâk-khurfu.\n5\tTalk to Náin the Slakeless at Zarkul-sulûn\tNáin the Slakeless can be found at Zarkul-sulûn in the War of Three Peaks. You have slain many foes in the War of Three Peaks, and you have heard the guidance of Agnar, Lági, and Reithvald in regard to Prince Durin's plan to reclaim Gundabad. You should return to Náin.\n6\tTalk to Durin at Annâk-khurfu\tDurin can be found in the war-room at Annâk-khurfu. Náin the Slakeless has advised you to bring word to Prince Durin that he should stay his hand in the war and consult his father, Thorin, at the Lonely Mountain.\n",
[1790]="70059DFE\n1\tFind King Thorin in the Hall Under the Mountain, in Erebor\tKing Thorin can be found in the Hall Under the Mountain, in Erebor. Hoping to set out for Elderslade, Hermáth Stormhammer has urged you to bid your farewells to King Thorin. You should find King Thorin in the Hall Under the Mountain.\n2\tTalk to King Thorin in the Hall Under the Mountain, in Erebor\tKing Thorin can be found at his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain at Erebor. After preparing for the journey to Elderslade, Hermáth Stormhammer has suggested the three of you speak to King Thorin. You should talk to King Thorin.\n3\tTalk to Hermáth Stormhammer in the Hall Under the Mountain, in Erebor\tHermáth Stormhammer can be found before King Thorin's throne in the Hall Under the Mountain at Erebor. After bidding farewell to King Thorin, Hermáth and Hersegg appear ready to begin the journey to Elderslade. You should talk to Hermáth Stormhammer.\n4\tTravel to Annâk-khurfu in Elderslade\tAnnâk-khurfu can be found in Elderslade. You should travel to Annâk-khurfu in Elderslade with Hermáth and Hersegg.\n5\tTalk to Hermáth Stormhammer at Annâk-khurfu\tHermáth Stormhammer can be found outside Annâk-khurfu in Elderslade. You have arrived at Annâk-khurfu in Elderslade. You should talk to Hermáth Stormhammer.\n6\tTalk to Hersegg at Annâk-khurfu\tHersegg can be found outside Annâk-khurfu in Elderslade. You have arrived at Annâk-khurfu in Elderslade and Hermáth Stormhammer has gone to speak to Prince Durin. You should talk to Hersegg.\n7\tFind Prince Durin and Hermáth Stormhammer in the war-room at Annâk-khurfu\tDurin can be found in the war-room at Annâk-khurfu. You have returned to Annâk-khurfu at last. You should find and talk to Durin.\n8\tTalk to Durin at Annâk-khurfu\tDurin can be found in the war-room at Annâk-khurfu. After Hermáth Stormhammer's arrival at Annâk-khurfu, Durin appears equally confused and awed. You should find and talk to Durin.\n",
[1791]="70059DFB\n1\tTravel to Akrâz-zahar in the Dwelling-halls of Tumnu-dûm, in Erebor\tAkrâz-zahar can be found in the Dwelling-halls of Tumnu-dûm, in Erebor. King Thorin has asked you to deliver a missive to Hersegg, granddaughter of Hermáth Stormhammer, at Akrâz-zahar that the wisdom of the Kharum-ubnâr might help guide Durin to victory. You should travel to Akrâz-zahar.\n2\tTalk to Frithgeir at Akrâz-zahar\tFrithgeir can be found at Akrâz-zahar in the Dwelling-halls of Tumnu-dûm, in Erebor. Upon entering Akrâz-zahar, you have come across the dwarf, Frithgeir, and his companion, Nár. You should talk to Frithgeir.\n3\tHail Nár at Akrâz-zahar\tNár can be found at Akrâz-zahar in the Dwelling-halls of Tumnu-dûm, in Erebor. Frithgeir hopes Nár might bid you well in your quest before he returns home to rest. You should hail Nár, and see if he wishes to say anything.\n4\tTalk to Frithgeir at Akrâz-zahar\tFrithgeir can be found at Akrâz-zahar in the Dwelling-halls of Tumnu-dûm, in Erebor. Nár's mind appears clouded, but he seemed to wish you well. You should talk to Frithgeir.\n5\tFind Hersegg in Akrâz-zahar\tHersegg can be found at Akrâz-zahar in the Dwelling-halls of Tumnu-dûm, in Erebor. After seeing Frithgeir and Nár off, you should return to your task and find Hersegg at Akrâz-zahar.\n6\tDeliver King Thorin's missive to Hersegg at Akrâz-zahar\tHersegg can be found at Akrâz-zahar in the Dwelling-halls of Tumnu-dûm, in Erebor. You have found Hersegg at Akrâz-zahar. You should deliver King Thorin's missive to Hersegg.\n",
[1792]="70059DFC\n1\tCollect letters (total: 12)\030Collect parcels (total: 8)\tLetters and parcels can be found within and without at Annâk-khurfu. Durin has asked you to collect the letters and parcels of Longbeards fighting in the War of Three Peaks before you depart for the Lonely Mountain.\n2\tTalk to Durin at Annâk-khurfu\tDurin can be found in the war-room at Annâk-khurfu. You have collected all of the letters and parcels prepared by the Longbeards of the Gabil'akkâ. You should return to Durin.\n3\tDeliver the letters, parcels, and Durin's missive to King Thorin in the Hall Under the Mountain, in Erebor\tKing Thorin can be found at his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain at Erebor. Durin has written a missive to be delivered to his father, Thorin, at Erebor. You should deliver the letters, parcels, and Durin's missive to King Thorin at Erebor.\n4\tTalk to King Thorin in the Hall Under the Mountain, in Erebor\tKing Thorin can be found at his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain at Erebor. You should talk to King Thorin.\n5\tListen to King Thorin's thoughts of his father, Dáin\030Listen to King Thorin's thoughts of his son, Durin\tKing Thorin can be found at his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain at Erebor. King Thorin is musing on thoughts of his son, Durin, and his father, Dáin.\n6\tTalk to King Thorin in the Hall Under the Mountain, in Erebor\tKing Thorin can be found at his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain at Erebor. You should talk to King Thorin.\n",
})
